# BAWAAL data integration & app logic (LOCKED)

Production contract for cloud sync, feed hydration, GAME ON filters, and reel social actions. Soft-fail offline / schema mismatch — never block Arena UX.

## 1. Tables, auth, media

| Surface | Contract |
|---|---|
| Profiles | `public.profiles` uuid → `auth.users`; RLS on; `upsertRegisteredProfile` after OTP (`profilesService.js`, `ENSURE_PROFILES_SPORTS_HUBS.sql`) |
| Auth | Phone OTP `signInWithOtp` → `verifyOtp` (`authOtp.js`); session via AsyncStorage (`lib/supabase.js` / `sessionStore.js`) |
| Arena challenges | `public.arena_challenges` — title, sport, video_url, user_id, created_at; RLS select/insert; realtime optional (`ENSURE_ARENA_CHALLENGES.sql`) |
| Videos / reels | Storage bucket `bawaalvideos` → public HTTPS URLs (`uploadService.js`); rows upsert `public.videos` onConflict `id` (`arenaPostsService.js`) |
| DMs | `public.direct_messages` (`ENSURE_DIRECT_MESSAGES.sql`) |
| Reel social | `reel_likes` / `reel_follows` / `reel_reposts` / `reel_tags` / `reel_banter` (`ENSURE_REEL_SOCIAL.sql`) |

## 2. Service layer & feed filters

- Fetch: `fetchArenaChallenges` / ArenaFeed hydrate — newest `created_at` first; soft schema fallbacks.
- Battle modes: `ARENA_FEED_TIERS` → `filterArenaFeedByTier` / `applyArenaFeedFilters`.
- Sports chips: `GAME_ON_SPORT_SECTIONS` → canonicalize via `sportCategory.js` → `filterArenaFeedBySport`.
- Active filters persist in `arenaFilterStore.js` (AsyncStorage + subscribers).
- Reel ⋮ actions: `dispatchReelSocialAction` (`reelSocialService.js`) — DM · Like · Follow/Unfollow · Share · Save · Banter · Comment · Send; local queue first, cloud insert/delete best-effort. Follow is sheet-only (no canvas CTA).

## 3. Local-first hydrate

- `arenaFeedStore.js`: local AsyncStorage → remote merge; shared `hydratePromise`; never throw.
- `sessionStore.js`: registration session for Passport / profile.
- Offline / RLS / missing table → device cache + Storage meta; UI stays responsive.

